#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:43
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Sqlite"
msgstr "Instalação do Sqlite"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:45
#, xml-text
msgid "Unpack the documentation:"
msgstr "Desempacote a documentação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:47
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">tar -xf ../sqlite-doc-&sqlite-doc-"
"version;.tar.xz</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">tar -xf ../sqlite-doc-&sqlite-doc-"
"version;.tar.xz</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:49
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Sqlite for compilation with:"
msgstr "Prepare o Sqlite para compilação com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:51
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-fts{4,5} \\\n"
"            CPPFLAGS=\"-D SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=1 \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_UNLOCK_NOTIFY=1   \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_DBSTAT_VTAB=1     \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_SECURE_DELETE=1\"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-fts{4,5} \\\n"
"            CPPFLAGS=\"-D SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=1 \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_UNLOCK_NOTIFY=1   \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_DBSTAT_VTAB=1     \\\n"
"                      -D SQLITE_SECURE_DELETE=1\"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:59
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções do configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:62
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-fts{4,5}</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-fts{4,5}</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:64
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"These switches enable support for version 4 and 5 of the full text search "
"(FTS) extension."
msgstr ""
"Essas chaves habilitam suporte para as versões 4 e 5 da extensão de pesquisa"
" de texto completo (PTC)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>CPPFLAGS=\"-D SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=1 ...</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>CPPFLAGS=\"-D SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=1 ...</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some applications require these options to be turned on. The only way to do "
"this is to include them in the CFLAGS or CPPFLAGS. We use the latter so the "
"default value (or any value set by the user) of CFLAGS won't be affected. "
"For further information on what can be specified see "
"https://www.sqlite.org/compile.html."
msgstr ""
"Alguns aplicativos exigem que essas opções estejam ativadas. A única maneira"
" de fazer isso é a de incluí-las em CFLAGS ou CPPFLAGS. Nós usamos esse "
"último, de forma que o valor padrão (ou qualquer valor configurado pelo(a) "
"usuário(a)) de CFLAGS não seja afetado. Para mais informações acerca do que "
"pode ser especificado, veja-se https://www.sqlite.org/compile.html."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:84
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make LDFLAGS.rpath=\"\"</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make LDFLAGS.rpath=\"\"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <parameter>LDFLAGS.rpath=\"\"</parameter> option prevents hard coding "
"library search paths (rpath) into the shared library.  This package does not"
" need rpath for an installation into the standard location, and rpath may "
"sometimes cause unwanted effects or even security issues."
msgstr ""
"A opção <parameter>LDFLAGS.rpath=\"\"</parameter> impede a codificação "
"rígida de caminhos de busca de bibliotecas (rpath) na biblioteca "
"compartilhada. Esse pacote não precisa do rpath para uma instalação no local"
" padrão, e o rpath pode, às vezes, causar efeitos indesejados ou até mesmo "
"problemas de segurança."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:96
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "If desired, install the documentation:"
msgstr "Se desejado, instale a documentação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/sqlite.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/sqlite-&sqlite-short-version;\n"
"cp -v -R sqlite-doc-&sqlite-doc-version;/* /usr/share/doc/sqlite-&sqlite-short-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/sqlite-&sqlite-short-version;\n"
"cp -v -R sqlite-doc-&sqlite-doc-version;/* /usr/share/doc/sqlite-&sqlite-short-version;</userinput>"

